  "releaseNotes": "- Minio client 7.0.0, RestSharp dependency removed\n- Exact file info via StatObject, one-level folder listings\n- Folder deletes in checked batches, provider root protected against delete, move and overwrite\n- Bucket created only on writes, reads buffered in a temporary file\n- Presigned download URLs (validity capped at 7 days)\n- HostAndPort may carry an http:// or https:// scheme",
